                                "example_id": "1e3d5deb-f5a7-4596-bb55-94524c884a46",
                                "sense_id": "a8fb76dd-af2a-3a1b-8001-8d5c046182a8",
                                "text": "[…] the old man's eccentricities, sometimes bordering on the ursine, repelled the juniors […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "144745ba-4086-4ed9-ad2d-b07cdc3a1cb7",
                                "sense_id": "a8fb76dd-af2a-3a1b-8001-8d5c046182a8",
                                "text": "[…] we noted that a preponderance of the evidence supports an ursine origin for the giant panda."
